      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For more context, I tend to use small \"round\" avatars when I'm in desktop mode and the \"in front\" option in some of these avatars causes the textbox to be either completely hidden.\n\nI essentially can't communicate with anyone the way I normally do unless I switch to an avatar with human proportions so I can tell them to switch it back to \"above.\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
