  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-04-14T05:47:04.474Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems everyone's chatbox setting has been overridden to the \"in front\" setting in the latest update. (2023.2.1)\n\nIn most cases, \"above\" is superior as the \"in front\" option often gets occluded when lying down or when in an especially wide/short avatar. This is pretty frustrating as I'm going to have to tell everyone to set it back to \"above.\"\n\nI'm not entirely sure if this is intentional or not, but considering it wasn't in the patch notes I'm submitting this here as a bug.",
